Other query forms (as in the search box of the website)
-------------------------------------------------------
crystod-search Sr,Ti,O                      # every material containing at least Sr, Ti and O
crystod-search ABO3                         # anonymous formula: each letter stands for any element
crystod-search '*TiO3'                      # formula with a wildcard element
crystod-search 'Sr-*'                       # Sr and one more element
crystod-search mp-5229,mp-5532              # material IDs
crystod-search Sr-Ti-O --subsystems --stable    # the convex hull of Sr-Ti-O, elements and binaries included
crystod-search Sr-Ti-O --experimental --get --directory   # one {formula}_{space group}_{ID}/POSCAR per starred entry
